{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48912","headline":"共佳人守岁 · 刘绮庄","name":"共佳人守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂华穷北陆，荆艳作东邻。\n残妆欲送晓，薄衣已迎春。\n举袖争流雪，分歌竞绕尘。\n不应将共醉，年去远催人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘绮庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}